---
import BaseLayout from './../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE, CONTACT_EMAIL } from '../consts';
---

<BaseLayout
	title={`About | ${SITE_TITLE}`}
	description="About George Mark — Computer Science undergraduate at the University of Nairobi who enjoys building things and understanding the why behind them."
>
	<div class="prose">
		<h1>About Me</h1>
		<p>
			Of all the 8.3 billion people existing on this mortal plane as of 2026, today you are
			interested in knowing more about me, I am flattered.
		</p>
		<p>
			I am currently doing my Undergrad in Computer Science at the University of Nairobi. I have
			done everything from Math, Business, Networks, Software development and Artificial
			Intelligence, that's just Computer Science for you.
		</p>
		<p>
			I believe I can learn anything and I enjoy building stuff, solving problems and
			understanding the why behind things, not just in tech. You'll find me exploring different
			frameworks and languages just because I can. I am currently building a personal fitness
			tool using FastAPI. I like Python.
		</p>
		<p>Outside computers, I like running, reading novels (classic fan) and watching movies, oops.</p>
		<p>
			That's all I am going to share. If you want to know more about me, send me an email
			<a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>here</a>, I will see that sooner. Or you can use one of
			the many links to my socials but I will take some time to reply. I am a chill guy I promise.
		</p>
		<p>-GM</p>
	</div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
	.prose {
		max-width: 760px;
		margin: 0 auto;
	}
</style>
